    Fix deletion of events for admins (#8313)
    
    The recently added checks for permission before deletion assume that
    hasPermission() of the XACMLAuthorizationService also checks for admin
    rights, which it does in fact not do (AI hallucination?). It only looks
    at the ACL and the episode id roles. This adds a check for admin rights
    in the necessary places as we already do in other services.
    PlaylistOffsetDataFetcher might also have been affected by this all
    along, but I didn't have time to figure out what that actually does, so
    I didn't touch it. (cc @Arnei ?)
    
    Fixes #8312.
